    <!-- Second paragraph of the dialog, under dialog_body_look_up_songs. %1$s is a length of time in words, e.g. "4 minutes" or "30 seconds". Songs that source no longer has are searched for one by one, which takes this long at most -->
    <!-- Asked before importing a playlist file of another service (an Exportify file of a Spotify playlist), whose songs must be searched for on YouTube Music -->
